    "text": "procedure Increase (X : in out Integer) with\n  Global => null,\n  Pre    => X <= 100,\n  Post   => X'Old < X;\n\nwith Increase;\nprocedure Client is\n   X : Integer := 0;\nbegin\n   while X <= 100 loop      --  The loop will terminate\n      Increase (X);         --  Increase can be called safely\n   end loop;\n   pragma Assert (X = 101); --  Will this hold?\nend Client;\n",
